    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "POCUS is highly valuable during CPR pauses to rapidly diagnose reversible ->. It is now explicitly endorsed in the 2025 AHA guidelines as a diagnostic adjunct when personnel & equipment are available."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
