        "attrs": {
         "hex": "000000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "Cardiac view (subxiphoid or parasternal): identify tamponade (pericardial effusion), severe hypovolemia (flat/empty ventricles), severe LV dysfunction, right ventricular dilation (PE pattern)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
